OL,3,GNEWSAPaul McCartney's item sells for
OL,4,Adouble the estimate
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo years after Sir Paul, his father,
OL,7,Fand brother moved out in 1963, American
OL,8,Fsuperfan Kathy Salt wrote to
OL,9,Fthen-occupant Ashley Jones, who
OL,10,Fenclosed a photograph of the house and
OL,11,Fa key, with a tag attached, in his
OL,12,Fletter back.
OL,14,FThe three items were up for sale at
OL,15,FDominic Winter Auctioneers in the
OL,16,FCotswolds on Wednesday and fetched a
OL,17,Fhammer price of #5,000, double the
OL,18,Festimate.
